I strongly advise you to dispose of a couple demon lord, steal the amulets they
carry and arrange for them to be listed first in your inventory (that is the
most difficult part). On the one time I managed to finish the game I had 3 such
amulets, the Wiz kept stealing them and coming back for the real thing, but
for some reason (*grin*) he never managed to live long enough to grab it; after
killing him, be sure to recover all your fake amulets as well - for the next
time he feels like being a boomer (pun intended).

